  "checks": [
    "All six exact reachable-subset tables, ordering, canonical members, witnesses, accepting flags and empty-sink inclusion/exclusion match the literal tables.",
    "All1023 binary words of length0..9 per machine: compare trace active-prefix sets with independent configuration reachability, raw moved sets with independently closed previous set, final acceptance and complete DFA path. Test fixed24symbol boundary words too.",
    "Empty input, epsilon cycles, accepting start closure, closure after symbol and vanished active sets are explicit; epsilon transitions consume no symbol.",
    "Machine admission returns an independent deep canonical copy and every API leaves input unchanged, including deep-frozen valid input. Refuse all specified invalid state/count/start/edge/unknown-key/duplicate/type/word boundaries without deleting invalid text.",
    "Actual generated standalone HTML in private current Chrome: analyze edited machine/word, inspect moved/closure/result/table; edits clear results and disable stale analysis download; invalid edits stay visible. Explicit replacement/preset behavior and keyboard focus are received.",
    "Capture actual course/guide/HTML/analysis downloads and compare exact pinned content/valid admitted analysis. Only fixed course JSON enters unchanged real RecallWeave learner import preview, explicit start and feedback/review. Blind12question receiving is separately owned by production_scope.",
    "Candidate/base/runtime, input fixtures and all package bytes pinned before and after; own children/listeners/profile isolated and retired with actual exits. No physical input, learning-benefit, global/browser-profile or source-main claim."
  ],
